  },
  "maxVersionNote": "1.0.2 16/10/2026 (#1375): re-cut of 1.0.1 with --move-only: a status colour set as text reads the slot's readable shade (--ds-c-<status>-text); nothing else moved, and unworn the page is the release's own (VERIFICATION.json).",
  "bands": {
    ".acm-slideshow": {
      "ground": "#1c1c1c",
      "texts": ["#ffffff"],
      "picture": true,
      "important": true
    }
  },
  "bandsNote": "drafted 2026-10-12 by scripts/bands.mjs off the released default page (/): each kept band that is not a picture wears the system's ground (src/bands.mjs), its words keep their colours",
  "containerGutter": 136,
  "containerGutterNote": "14/10/2026 (visual review): the features band's decorative picture (div.features-image) hangs 120px off the container's right edge; under Notion, Apple, ElevenLabs and Stripe it was cut at the window's edge. The container keeps 136px from the window's edges instead of 32."
